@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `il31-nouns`

-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 66(c)(4)-(6): the earlier vintages (BACKLOG IL-31, part A).
--
-- WHAT THE THREE ACTS DO. Each is an Act of amendment: it says "in place of X put Y", never the
-- whole text. So what they give is a CHAIN, and a chain can be walked forward from a base text
-- but not backward from the current one without the words each step replaced.
--
--   SH 2972 (18 May 2022, amendment 260): for income produced from 1 January to 31 December
--     2022 only, a further credit point for a child under 13 who is not a toddler (s 66(c)(4)(d),
--     (5A), and (6) pointing at both). A temporary provision: it adds, and it ends.
--   SH 3048 (7 June 2023, amendment 267), s 2(2): rewrites (4)(a), deletes (4)(b) and (c), and in
--     (5) deletes "toddlers", adds (c). s 3(a) and (d): from 1 January 2024, on income produced
--     from that day, "provided that by then the Budget Law for 2024 has been adopted".
--   SH 3184 (20 March 2024, amendment 271), s 1(2): replaces the opening of (4)(a) up to "five
--     years", and (5)(a) and (b). s 3: the text of ss 40 and 66 "as worded in s 1 of this Law"
--     commences on 1 January 2024. It has no condition.
--
-- WHAT THAT LETS THIS MODULE ANSWER.
--   * tax year 2024 and later: the text those two Acts leave. The credit points the Acts' own
--     words give a child, by the child's age in tax years, are encoded below, WITHOUT the mother's
--     birth-year election of (4)(a1), whose enacting Act (the 5783 Act tagged תשפ״ג־2 in the
--     section's amendment list) is not deposited. Row IL-02 holds the full current text.
--   * tax year 2022: only the ADDITION SH 2972 makes. The base text it adds to is not deposited.
--   * tax year 2023 and earlier: nothing. The base text of (4), (5) and (6), and the definition
--     of "toddler" (פעוט) that SH 3048 deleted from s 40(b)(3), are not in any deposited source.
--     Each such year is declined BY NAME, and the name says what source is needed.
--
-- Hebrew in `-- src:N |` lines is copied mechanically from line N of the deposited consolidation;
-- Hebrew in `-- act:` lines is the Act's own words, read from the page image and checked against
-- the PDF text layer (NOTES.md section 7).

§ `Section 66(c)(4)-(6) before 2024`

§§ `The vintage a tax year falls in`

-- SH 3048 s 3(a) and (d); SH 3184 s 3: the amended text begins on 1 January 2024 and applies to
-- income produced from that day, so the first tax year it governs is 2024 (a tax year is a
-- calendar year; a special assessment period is not modelled).
-- act: SH 3184 s 3 | תחילתם של סעיפים 40 ו־66 לפקודה, כנוסחם בסעיף 1 לחוק זה, ביום כ׳ בטבת התשפ״ד (1 בינואר 2024)
-- act: SH 3048 s 3(d) | סעיף 2 לחוק זה יחול על הכנסה שהופקה מיום התחילה ואילך
@ref Acts SH 3048 s 3(a), (d) and SH 3184 s 3
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the first tax year of the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) that Acts SH 3048 and SH 3184 leave` MEANS 2024

@ref Acts SH 2972 s 1 (income produced from 1 January to 31 December 2022), SH 3048 s 3, SH 3184 s 3
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A vintage of section 66(c)(4)-(6)`
`the vintage of section 66(c)(4)-(6) that governs tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` AT LEAST `the first tax year of the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) that Acts SH 3048 and SH 3184 leave`
           THEN `the text of Acts SH 3048 and SH 3184, from tax year 2024`
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2023
           THEN `the base text, in tax year 2023`
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2022
           THEN `the base text with the temporary provision of Act SH 2972, in tax year 2022`
           OTHERWISE `a text before tax year 2022`

§§ `The refusals, by name`

@ref Act SH 3048 s 2(2), SH 3184 s 1(2); the section's amendment list, source line 2454
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) in tax year 2023 needs a source` MEANS
    REFUSE "the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) in tax year 2023 needs a source: its text before Act SH 3048 (paragraphs (4), (5) and (6), and the definition of a toddler in section 40(b)(3)), and the 5783 Act tagged in the amendment list, none of which is deposited"

@ref Act SH 2972 s 1; the section's amendment list, source line 2454
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) in tax year 2022 needs a source` MEANS
    REFUSE "the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) in tax year 2022 needs a source: the base text on which Act SH 2972 only adds, which is not deposited"

@ref the section's amendment list, source line 2454
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) before tax year 2022 needs a source` MEANS
    REFUSE "the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) before tax year 2022 needs a source: the amending Acts of those years are not deposited"

-- The refusal that fits the vintage of a tax year before 2024.
@ref Acts SH 2972, SH 3048, SH 3184
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
      a              IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) for a tax year before 2024 needs a source, for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2023 THEN `the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) in tax year 2023 needs a source`
           IF `the tax year` EQUALS 2022 THEN `the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) in tax year 2022 needs a source`
           OTHERWISE `the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) before tax year 2022 needs a source`

§§ `Tax year 2024 and later: the credit points the Acts give a child`

-- The two columns. Ages are counted in tax years from the year of birth ("שנת לידה" and
-- "שנת בגרות" as s 40(b)(3) defines them: the year of birth, and the tax year in which the child
-- turns eighteen). Read from SH 3184 s 1(2)(a) and (b) and SH 3048 s 2(2)(a)(1) and (b)(3).
--
-- THE WOMAN, paragraph (4)(a) as it stands after SH 3184:
-- src:2466 | (א) 2 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיה בשנת לידתו, ו־ 1 ⁄ 2 נקודת זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיה בשנת בגרותו, 4 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיה החל בשנת המס שלאחר שנת לידתו ועד לשנת המס שבה מלאו לו שנתיים, 3 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיה בשנת המס שבה מלאו לו שלוש שנים, 2 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיה בשנות המס שבהן מלאו לו ארבע שנים וחמש שנים, ושתי נקודות זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיה החל בשנת המס שבה מלאו לו שש שנים ועד לשנת המס שקדמה לשנת בגרותו; לעניין זה ולעניין פסקה (5), ”שנת לידה“ ו”שנת בגרות“ – כהגדרתן בסעיף 40(ב)(3);
-- (The consolidation's line is the same words the two Acts leave; here the Acts alone are the
-- source: SH 3184 replaced the opening up to "five years", and SH 3048 had added the rest.)
--   age 0 (year of birth)                    2 1/2
--   age 1 and 2 (the year after birth until the tax year of turning two)   4 1/2
--   age 3                                    3 1/2
--   age 4 and 5                              2 1/2
--   age 6 to 17 (to the tax year before the year of maturity)              2
--   age 18 (the year of maturity)            1/2
@ref Acts SH 3184 s 1(2)(a), SH 3048 s 2(2)(a)(1); source line 2466
GIVEN `the age in tax years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 66(c)(4)(a) — the credit points for a child of` `the age in tax years` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the age in tax years` EQUALS 0 THEN 2.5
           IF `the age in tax years` AT LEAST 1 AND `the age in tax years` AT MOST 2 THEN 4.5
           IF `the age in tax years` EQUALS 3 THEN 3.5
           IF `the age in tax years` AT LEAST 4 AND `the age in tax years` AT MOST 5 THEN 2.5
           IF `the age in tax years` AT LEAST 6 AND `the age in tax years` AT MOST 17 THEN 2
           IF `the age in tax years` EQUALS 18 THEN 0.5
           OTHERWISE 0

-- THE MAN, paragraph (5) as it stands after SH 3048 and SH 3184:
-- src:2474 | (א) 2 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בשנת לידתו של הילד;
-- src:2475 | (ב) 4 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בשל כל ילד החל בשנת המס שלאחר לידתו ועד לשנת המס שבה מלאו לו שנתיים, 3 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בשנת המס שבה מלאו לו שלוש שנים, ו־2 1 ⁄ 2 נקודות זיכוי בשנות המס שבהן מלאו לו ארבע שנים וחמש שנים;
-- src:2476 | (ג) נקודת זיכוי אחת בעד כל אחד מילדיו החל בשנת המס שבה מלאו לו שש שנים ועד לשנת המס שקדמה לשנת בגרותו;
--   age 0                                    2 1/2     (a), "1 1/2" replaced by "2 1/2" in SH 3184 s 1(2)(b)(1)
--   age 1 and 2                              4 1/2     (b), as SH 3184 s 1(2)(b)(2) replaced it
--   age 3                                    3 1/2
--   age 4 and 5                              2 1/2
--   age 6 to 17                              1         (c), added by SH 3048 s 2(2)(b)(3)
--   age 18                                   none: (5) names no point for the year of maturity
@ref Acts SH 3184 s 1(2)(b), SH 3048 s 2(2)(b); source lines 2474-2476
GIVEN `the age in tax years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 66(c)(5) — the credit points for a child of` `the age in tax years` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the age in tax years` EQUALS 0 THEN 2.5
           IF `the age in tax years` AT LEAST 1 AND `the age in tax years` AT MOST 2 THEN 4.5
           IF `the age in tax years` EQUALS 3 THEN 3.5
           IF `the age in tax years` AT LEAST 4 AND `the age in tax years` AT MOST 5 THEN 2.5
           IF `the age in tax years` AT LEAST 6 AND `the age in tax years` AT MOST 17 THEN 1
           OTHERWISE 0

-- (4A) points the woman who married a widower at his children "as in paragraph (4)"; (6) points
-- the man who married a widow at hers "as in paragraph (5)".
@ref source lines 2472, 2473, 2478
GIVEN `the claimant` IS A `A claimant under section 66(c)(4)-(6)`
      `the age in tax years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit points the paragraph gives` `the claimant` `for a child of` `the age in tax years` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claimant`
    WHEN `a woman, under paragraph (4)`                           THEN `s 66(c)(4)(a) — the credit points for a child of` `the age in tax years`
    WHEN `a woman who married a widower, under paragraph (4A)`    THEN `s 66(c)(4)(a) — the credit points for a child of` `the age in tax years`
    WHEN `a man, under paragraph (5)`                             THEN `s 66(c)(5) — the credit points for a child of` `the age in tax years`
    WHEN `a man who married a widow, under paragraph (6)`         THEN `s 66(c)(5) — the credit points for a child of` `the age in tax years`

-- THE ENTRY: ask section 66(c)(4)-(6) for a tax year. From 2024 the Acts' text answers (before
-- the (4)(a1) election); before 2024 the answer is the refusal that names the missing source.
@ref Acts SH 3048 s 2(2), SH 3184 s 1(2), s 3; section 66(c)(4)-(6), source lines 2465-2478
GIVEN `the claimant`  IS A `A claimant under section 66(c)(4)-(6)`
      `the child`     IS A `A child in section 66(c)`
      `the tax year`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 66(c)(4)-(6) — the credit points of` `the claimant` `for` `the child` `in tax year` `the tax year` `, before any election under (4)(a1)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the tax year` LESS THAN `the first tax year of the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) that Acts SH 3048 and SH 3184 leave`
           THEN `the text of section 66(c)(4)-(6) for a tax year before 2024 needs a source, for tax year` `the tax year`
           OTHERWISE `the credit points the paragraph gives` `the claimant` `for a child of` (`the tax year` MINUS `the child`'s `tax year of birth`)

§§ `Tax year 2022: the addition Act SH 2972 makes`

-- act: SH 2972 s 1 | בתקופה שמיום כ״ח בטבת התשפ״ב (1 בינואר 2022) עד יום ז׳ בטבת התשפ״ג (31 בדצמבר 2022), יקראו את פקודת מס הכנסה, לגבי הכנסה שהופקה בתקופה האמורה כך
@ref Act SH 2972 s 1
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Act SH 2972 reads the Ordinance for income produced in tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    `the tax year` EQUALS 2022

-- Whether a child "who in 2022 had not yet completed thirteen years" is under the limit. The text
-- does not say on which day of 2022 the age is tested. A child born in 2009 completes thirteen
-- years during 2022: (i) counted in tax years, that child has completed them in 2022 and is out;
-- (ii) tested at the start of 2022, that child has not and is in. Every other birth year gets the
-- same answer on both readings (born 2010 or later: in; born 2008 or earlier: out), so the
-- default declines for 2009 only. Ruled by Meng 2026-10-08 (SHRUG).
-- act: SH 2972 s 1(2)(a) | אשר בשנת 2022 טרם מלאו לו שלוש עשרה שנים
@ref Act SH 2972 s 1(2)(a), (b); fork A1 in NOTES.md
GIVEN `the tax year of birth` IS A NUMBER
      `the reading`           IS A `A reading of Act SH 2972 on the age limit of thirteen years in 2022`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Act SH 2972 — the child has not yet completed thirteen years in 2022, born in tax year` `the tax year of birth` `, reading the age limit as` `the reading` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the reading`
    WHEN `the age is counted in tax years, so a child born in 2009 has completed thirteen years in 2022`
        THEN (2022 MINUS `the tax year of birth`) LESS THAN 13
    WHEN `the age is tested at the start of 2022, so a child born in 2009 has not completed thirteen years`
        THEN (2022 MINUS `the tax year of birth`) AT MOST 13
    WHEN `declined where the reading changes the answer`
        THEN BRANCH IF `the tax year of birth` EQUALS 2009
                    THEN `section 66(c)(4)(d), (5A) as Act SH 2972 gives them: the readings of the age limit of thirteen years part for a child born in 2009`
                    OTHERWISE (2022 MINUS `the tax year of birth`) LESS THAN 13

@ref Act SH 2972 s 1(2)(a), (b); fork A1 in NOTES.md
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 66(c)(4)(d), (5A) as Act SH 2972 gives them: the readings of the age limit of thirteen years part for a child born in 2009` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 66(c)(4)(d), (5A) as Act SH 2972 gives them: the readings of the age limit of thirteen years part for a child born in 2009, and the text does not decide which day of 2022 the age is tested"

-- THE SWITCH: the reading this row takes. Ruled by Meng 2026-10-08 (SHRUG): decline.
@ref Act SH 2972 s 1(2)(a), (b); fork A1 in NOTES.md
GIVETH A `A reading of Act SH 2972 on the age limit of thirteen years in 2022`
`section 66(c)(4)(d), (5A) — the reading this row takes for the age limit of thirteen years in 2022` MEANS
    `declined where the reading changes the answer`

-- THE ADDITION. One further credit point, for a child who in 2022 had not completed thirteen
-- years and is not a toddler, to each of the four claimants; none otherwise, and none in any tax
-- year but 2022 (the Act ends on 31 December 2022). THIS IS THE ADDITION ONLY: it is added to
-- credit points that the base text gives and this row does not hold. Whether the child is a
-- toddler is the definition SH 3048 deleted from s 40(b)(3); it is not deposited, so the caller
-- says it, and a toddler gets nothing from this provision whatever the age limit.
-- act: SH 2972 s 1(2)(a) | נקודת זיכוי אחת נוספת על נקודות הזיכוי לפי פסקת משנה (ב), בעד כל אחד מילדיה, אשר בשנת 2022 טרם מלאו לו שלוש עשרה שנים והוא אינו פעוט כהגדרתו בסעיף 40(ב)(3)
-- act: SH 2972 s 1(2)(b) | הגבר יהיה זכאי, כנגד המס החל על הכנסתו מיגיעה אישית, לנקודת זיכוי בעד כל אחד מילדיו אשר בשנת 2022 טרם מלאו לו שלוש עשרה שנים והוא אינו פעוט כהגדרתו בסעיף 40(ב)(3)
-- act: SH 2972 s 1(2)(c) | כאמור בפסקאות (5) או (5א), לפי העניין
@ref Act SH 2972 s 1(2)(a) (paragraph (4)(d)), (b) (paragraph (5A)), (c) (paragraph (6)); paragraph (4A), source line 2472
GIVEN `the claimant`  IS A `A claimant under section 66(c)(4)-(6)`
      `the child`     IS A `A child in section 66(c)`
      `a toddler under the definition of section 40(b)(3) as it stood in 2022` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the tax year`  IS A NUMBER
      `the reading`   IS A `A reading of Act SH 2972 on the age limit of thirteen years in 2022`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Act SH 2972 — the further credit point of` `the claimant` `for` `the child` `, toddler status` `a toddler under the definition of section 40(b)(3) as it stood in 2022` `, in tax year` `the tax year` `, reading the age limit as` `the reading` MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT `Act SH 2972 reads the Ordinance for income produced in tax year` `the tax year` THEN 0
           IF `a toddler under the definition of section 40(b)(3) as it stood in 2022` THEN 0
           IF `Act SH 2972 — the child has not yet completed thirteen years in 2022, born in tax year` (`the child`'s `tax year of birth`) `, reading the age limit as` `the reading`
           THEN 1
           OTHERWISE 0

-- The same, reading the age limit as the switch above reads it.
@ref Act SH 2972 s 1(2); fork A1 in NOTES.md
GIVEN `the claimant`  IS A `A claimant under section 66(c)(4)-(6)`
      `the child`     IS A `A child in section 66(c)`
      `a toddler under the definition of section 40(b)(3) as it stood in 2022` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the tax year`  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Act SH 2972 — the further credit point of` `the claimant` `for` `the child` `, toddler status` `a toddler under the definition of section 40(b)(3) as it stood in 2022` `, in tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    `Act SH 2972 — the further credit point of` `the claimant` `for` `the child` `, toddler status` `a toddler under the definition of section 40(b)(3) as it stood in 2022` `, in tax year` `the tax year` `, reading the age limit as` `section 66(c)(4)(d), (5A) — the reading this row takes for the age limit of thirteen years in 2022`
